- eth0.20 = 172.16.20.1/24
Kernel routes for 172.16.10.0/24 and 172.16.20.0/24 are installed on eth0.10 and eth0.20, respectively. Interface counters on both sub-interfaces show RX/TX traffic, proving tagged VLAN frames are being received and forwarded. Both end hosts have correct default gateways (.1 in their VLANs).

